== Overview ==
Classic 1x1x1x1 was an [[Enemies|enemy]] after [[1x1x1x1]] transforms into his old form.

== Appearance ==
He has no tool whatsoever, His torso is dark green (Not showing his bones), his head is almost like a ball, his skin is white, his legs are light blue.

== Strategy ==
This [[Enemies|enemy]] is not that strong, so  [[Classic Cameraman]] or any other tower that deals high damage can easily defeat him.

== Trivia ==

* Classic 1x1x1x1 is the first ever thing in Toilet Tower Defence to have a cutscene.
* Classic 1x1x1x1 is based on one of the original avatars used by 1x1x1x1.
* Classic 1x1x1x1 used to only spawn on [[Crossroads]].
* He is 1.747913842151867 times weaker than the original boss
* He can do AoE stun
* This is the second [[Enemies|enemy]] which isn't toilet , first one is [[Infected Titan Speakerman]]

